    "solution_text_EN_0": "One boat is empty. If the woman beside the crate is on Dock B,",
    "solution_text_FR_0": "",
    "solution_text_EN_1": "then there would be two empty boats. And B and the woman",
    "solution_text_FR_1": "",
    "solution_text_EN_2": "cannot be in the Warehouse or they would block D in the Fishmarket.",
    "solution_text_FR_2": "",
    "solution_text_EN_3": "So D must be the woman beside the crate, in the Fishmarket.",
    "solution_text_FR_3": "",
    "solution_text_EN_4": "This sets D in row 8. This sets B in row 9, this isolates H and C.",
